# Lake build artifacts and vendored dependencies.
# lean/math201/.lake alone is ~7 GB / 120k files — Mathlib source plus
# compiled .olean. All of it is reproducible with `lake exe cache get`,
# so none of it belongs in the repo.
.lake/
build/
*.olean
*.ilean
*.trace
*.hash

# Third-party Lean course repos, cloned not authored. Each carries its own
# .git and its own lean-toolchain pin (math2001 is on Lean v4.3.0, not our
# v4.32.1 — elan honours the per-directory pin, so they coexist). Reproduce
# with:  git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/hrmacbeth/math2001.git
# Anything worth keeping gets ported into lean/math201/ against current
# Mathlib, which is where the graded Lean deliverables live.
lean/math2001/

# Office lock/owner files — created while a workbook is open, deleted on close.
# `~$Problem1_2.xlsx` showed up mid-session; it is not work, it is a mutex.
~$*

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
